    "brief": {
      "faqs": [
        {
          "a": "We welcome both appointments and walk-ins. However, we recommend booking ahead to ensure availability, especially during peak hours. You can schedule online or call us directly.",
          "q": "Do I need an appointment or do you accept walk-ins?"
        },
        {
          "a": "Our barbershop specializes in traditional and contemporary men's cuts, fades, and beard grooming. Our salon offers cuts, color, treatments, and styling for all hair types and genders. Many clients enjoy having one trusted team for their entire beauty needs.",
          "q": "What's the difference between your barbershop and salon services?"
        },
        {
          "a": "Haircuts typically take 30-45 minutes depending on complexity. Color services range from 1-3 hours based on your hair length and desired result. We'll provide a time estimate when you book.",
          "q": "How long does a typical haircut or color service take?"
        },
        {
          "a": "Your satisfaction is our priority. If you have concerns about your service, please let us know immediately. We're happy to make adjustments or corrections to ensure you leave feeling confident.",
          "q": "What if I'm not happy with my cut or color?"
        },
        {
          "a": "Yes, we specialize in bridal parties, event styling, and special occasion preparation. We recommend booking well in advance and scheduling a consultation to discuss your vision.",
          "q": "Do you offer services for special occasions like weddings or events?"
        }
      ],
      "about_angle": "Founded on the belief that great hair starts with expertise and attention to detail, Blown Away Salon and Bon Air Barbershop brings together master barbers and stylists who understand that every cut, color, and style tells your story. We combine traditional barbering craftsmanship with modern salon innovation to deliver results that turn heads.",
      "hero_headline": "Where Precision Meets Style",
      "differentiators": [
        "Dual concept combining men's barbershop and women's salon services under one roof",
        "Specialized expertise in both classic barbering and modern salon techniques",
        "Personalized consultation approach with experienced stylists/barbers",
        "Local Louisville presence with understanding of regional style preferences",
        "Comprehensive service menu reducing the need for multiple beauty professionals",
        "Professional atmosphere that welcomes both traditional and contemporary clientele"
      ],
      "hero_subheadline": "Premium barbering and salon services for Louisville's most discerning clients",
      "tone_recommendation": "Professional yet approachable—confident in expertise without being pretentious. Balance expertise and craftsmanship language with warm, welcoming service messaging. Speak to both clients seeking classic barbering traditions and those exploring modern salon trends. Use 'we' language that emphasizes teamwork and personalized care."
